A cozy Christmas living room scene in comic book style with bold ink outlines and halftone dot shading. A wide-eyed child in pajamas kneels eagerly before a decorated Christmas tree, hands clasped together in hopeful anticipation, gazing up at a tired-looking Santa Claus slumped in an armchair. Santa has dark circles under his eyes and looks longingly at a wrapped rectangular gaming console-shaped present under the tree, his expression mirroring the child's desperate wanting. The room glows with warm holiday colors—reds, greens, and golden fairy lights. Stockings hang from a fireplace mantel. The comedic tension between who really wants the gift more is palpable. Dynamic comic panel composition with dramatic shadows and vibrant saturated colors typical of classic comic book illustration.
